{"id":"664988","name":"番茄土豆蔬菜汤","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/664988/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"番茄","amount":"适量"},{"name":"土豆","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"木耳","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白菜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"番茄洗净去皮切块。","img":"images/664988/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"白菜洗净切块备用。","img":"images/664988/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"土豆去皮洗净切片。","img":"images/664988/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中热油放入番茄。","img":"images/664988/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"番茄炒出茄汁后加入适量清水。","img":"images/664988/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入土豆片。","img":"images/664988/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"大火煮开转小火煲30分钟左右。","img":"images/664988/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"木耳提前泡发洗净。","img":"images/664988/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"将木耳改刀切细。","img":"images/664988/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"分钟左右土豆煲粉糯后放入木耳。","img":"images/664988/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入白菜。","img":"images/664988/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"大火煮开至白菜断生，少许盐调味即可。","img":"images/664988/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664988/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664988/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}